<title>PHILIPPINES: Uniwide unit to build mixed-use complex.</title>
<headline>Uniwide unit to build mixed-use complex.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniwide Holdings Inc said on Thursday its subsidiary Uniwide Sales Realty and Resources Corp had entered into a joint venture agreement to develop a 574,262 square metre lot into a mixed-use complex.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Maria Concepcion Noche told the Philippine Stock Exchange that Uniwide and local land owners will develop 51 contiguous parcels of land in Quezon province, just south of Manila, into a joint commercial and residential estate.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938, Fax 8176267</p>
